ule alone. Non-numeric keys abort the call via `int(k)` (**aborts-cycle** only once wired onto a hot path—not declared blocking because this head does not attach it).\n\n## Owner rules\n\n**Inferred:** membership/universe code fail-closed on receipt quality; this diff does not alter admission or coverage. **Measured:** no conflict with pinned membership denominator rules in `snapshot_coverage.py` because nothing is hooked up yet.\n\n## Settled-check\n\n**guess:** `r1b_perf_07` naming suggests a roadmap perf slice; fixture has no roadmap doc to settle whether orphan module-first landings are approved—treat as open until Joshua confirms split PR is OK.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nMODIFY: land universe export + metrics at the real merge entry, or narrow title/body; add key parsing consistent with `load_membership_receipt` before production use.",
