            "body": "## Summary\n\nSingle-file change: when `CLIENT_SECRET` resolves to the default sentinel (`unset` via missing env or empty string), membership removal grace is **0** instead of `STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` (172800). When a real secret is configured, behavior matches base (**measured** from diff + head read).\n\n## Trace (real entry point)\n\n`_compute_membership` marks `validity == \"negative\"` and calls `_eligible_for_removal`; `_shrink_allowed` uses the same helper before publishing a smaller universe (**measured**). The new env read happens only inside `_eligible_for_removal`.\n\n## Edge cases\n\n| Input | Grace | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `CLIENT_SECRET` absent | 0 | **measured**: `None` → `_client_secret_default` → `\"unset\"` |\n| `CLIENT_SECRET=\"\"` | 0 | **inferred**: falsy → sentinel |\n| `CLIENT_SECRET` set (non-empty) | 172800 | **measured** |\n| Literal value `\"unset\"` | 0 | **inferred**: treated like default |\n\n`(now - started).total_seconds() >= grace` uses integer grace only; no multiply/overflow path to `inf`/`NaN` here (**measured**).\n\nWith grace **0**, a netuid with `probe is False`, valid `negative_since`, and `now >= started` can drop on the same refresh cycle — consistent with the PR title (**inferred**). That makes `_shrink_allowed` pass sooner, not block shrink (**inferred**).\n\n## Non-blocking notes (P3)\n\n- `_compute_membership` docstring still says \"48h grace\" unconditionally; it is now env-dependent (**inferred**).\n- Production workers should always set `CLIENT_SECRET`; if unset in prod, universe membership would shrink immediately on chain-negative evidence instead of after 48h (**inferred** operational coupling, appears intentional per title).\n\nNo blocking findings under never-expires / overflow / aborts-cycle / poisons-later-row.\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Traced env → `_eligible_for_removal` → drop/shrink publish path; exercised absent/empty/set secret and grace comparison | — |\n| owner-rules | Chain-negative + probe-false removal path unchanged except grace duration; aligns with dev-fast path when secret unset | — |\n| settled-check | PR title states intent; no contradicting lock in fixture files | — |",
