            "verdict": "MODIFY",
            "body": "## Summary\n\nRefactor moves membership list derivation into `internal/council/snapshot_coverage.py`, but the new helper is **not** behavior-preserving relative to base.\n\n## Findings\n\n### P1 — `r1b_member_netuids_from_map_f` drops root (netuid 0) from `netuids` (**inferred** from diff + head call site)\n\n**Base** (`internal/subnet_universe.py` `_compute_membership`):\n\n`netuids = sorted(int(k) for k in validity_map.keys())`\n\n**Head** (per `get_pr_diff`): helper returns `sorted(int(k) for k in validity_map.keys() if int(k))`, which omits `0` even when key `\"0\"` remains in `validity_map`.\n\n**Measured** at head: `_compute_membership` still adds `ROOT_NETUID` to `candidates` and can write `validity_map[\"0\"]`, and `ROOT_NETUID` comment states membership adds root. **Measured**: `_shrink_allowed` requires drop evidence for every netuid in `set(prior.netuids) - set(build.snapshot.netuids)` with no root carve-out; root is never `_eligible_for_removal`.\n\n**Inferred** impact: any persisted snapshot whose `netuids` includes `0` (expected under base behavior when root was admitted) will hit \"Unsafe shrink blocked\" on refresh after this change, leaving `_hold_prior` degraded state and preventing adoption of otherwise-valid builds. Downstream receipt field `root_netuid_in_membership` (`0 in snap.netuids` in `load_membership_receipt`) also diverges from prior semantics.\n\n**Fix direction**: either preserve the base sort exactly in the shared helper (no `if int(k)` filter), or explicitly document and implement root policy consistently (including shrink/receipt) with tests.\n\n### P3 — Mid-function import (**inferred**)\n\nLazy import of `snapshot_coverage` inside `_compute_membership` adds coupling on the hot refresh path; prefer module-level import if cycle-safe, or keep helper in `subnet_universe` until import graph is clean.\n\n## Blocking\n\nRoot exclusion without shrink/receipt alignment → bad inherited snapshot state on refresh (`poisons-later-row`).\n\n## Skills\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Traced `validity_map` → `netuids` → `SnapshotBuilder.build` → `_shrink_allowed` / `load_membership_receipt` | — |\n| owner-rules | Membership/root and fail-closed shrink gate | — |\n| settled-check | No in-repo r1b doc in fixture; treated as new behavior | — |",
