ged |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Traced boot → `ensure_background_refresh` → `ensure_refresh_loop` / `refresh_once` writer gate | — |\n| owner-rules | No change to chain-wins / 48h grace / shrink evidence; writer-only publish unchanged | — |\n| settled-check | Worker publishes, web reloads persisted snapshot — established split; not re-litigating | — |",
