tradable_subnet` semantics used elsewhere in `tradable.py` and `snapshot_coverage.py`.\n\n### P3 — inline import (**inferred**)\nLazy import inside `_compute_membership` is inconsistent with module-level imports in the same file; minor style only.\n\n## Adversarial extremes\n- Non-numeric `validity_map` keys: **inferred** — `int(x)` still raises and aborts `_compute_membership` (same as base); not a regression.\n- `1e308` / volume paths: **skipped** — unchanged in this diff.\n\n## Owner / settled\n- Root is not tradable: **measured** in `tradable.py` and coverage helpers; this diff aligns list building with that policy.\n- Chain-wins removal grace: **measured** unchanged in `_merge_sources` / `_eligible_for_removal`.\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Traced `_compute_membership` → `SnapshotBuilder.build` → `refresh_once` / `_shrink_allowed`; Root exclusion triggers shrink hold when LKG has `0` | — |\n| owner-rules | Root must not inflate universe; shrink must not drop members without evidence — conflict for Root ejection | — |\n| settled-check | Root exclusion from tradable/scoring set already settled in `tradable.py` + `snapshot_coverage.py` | — |",
