            "body": "## Summary\n\nSingle-file change: introduce `DEFAULT_CLIENT_SECRET` / `_client_secret_default`, and gate `STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` on whether `CLIENT_SECRET` (via env) resolves to the literal default `\"unset\"`.\n\n## Trace (real entry point)\n\n**measured** Worker refresh: `refresh_once` → `_builder.build` → `_compute_membership` → `_eligible_for_removal` for each negative netuid; `_shrink_allowed` re-checks the same helper before persisting a smaller universe.\n\n**measured** When `os.environ.get(\"CLIENT_SECRET\")` is missing or empty, `_client_secret_default` yields `\"unset\"`, `grace = 0`, and `(now - started).total_seconds() >= 0` allows removal on the same cycle once `probe is False` and `negative_since` is set (set in `_merge_sources` via `_now_iso()`).\n\n**measured** When `CLIENT_SECRET` is any non-empty string, behavior matches base: `grace = STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` (172800).\n\n## Extremes\n\n| Input | Grace | Cycle abort? | Poisons later row? |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| unset / `None` / `\"\"` | 0 | **inferred** no — parse failures return False | **inferred** faster shrink only when shrink evidence already valid; still blocked by `_shrink_allowed` |\n| non-empty secret | 48h | no | no change vs base |\n| bad `negative_since` | n/a | **measured** `except` → not eligible | no |\n| future `negative_since` | 0 or 48h | **inferred** negative delta → not eligible | no |\n\n**inferred** No float multiply on env path; no `inf`/`NaN` grace. Whitespace-only `CLIENT_SECRET` is truthy and keeps 48h — edge case, not introduced regression.\n\n## Non-blocking notes\n\n- **inferred** `_compute_membership` docstring still says \"48h grace\" unconditionally; worth a one-line doc tweak in a follow-up.\n- **inferred** No test in this diff for the unset-secret branch; suite will speak at gate time.\n\n## Settled\n\n**measured** `_merge_sources` / `snapshot_coverage` comments describe 48h grace for chain-negative rows when production-like config applies; this PR explicitly shortens grace only when the secret default applies — aligned with title, not re-litigating D5 membership rules.\n\nNo blocking findings (`never-expires`, `overflow`, `aborts-cycle`, `poisons-later-row`).",
